  <Info>
    <Name URL="">Khmer Phonetic</Name>
    <Copyright URL="">© Keang Pakrinha</Copyright>
    <Author URL="mailto:keang.pakrinha@gmail.com">Keang Pakrinha</Author>
    <Version URL=""></Version>
    <WebSite URL="https://keyman.com/keyboards/khmer_phonetic">https://keyman.com/keyboards/khmer_phonetic</WebSite>
    <Description URL="">Type Khmer by sound, written in Latin letters: sousdey becomes សួស្តី.
Spelling is forgiving, so sousdey, suosdei and susadey all reach the same word.
A 20,000 word dictionary supplies predictions on phones and tablets.</Description>
  </Info>
